picks the HUITZIL cell (id 0x10), which this build does not back (donovan-m3a
backs only Donovan at 0x13). The exact twin of huitzil-m2's 11_pick_donovan
skip. The tenant pick on this build is covered by 11_pick_donovan; the replay
itself is NOT dead — huitzil-m2 and pyron-m2 both carry a real .sha1 for it.

Added 14z-78 (maintainer sign-off). The replay landed in 14z-67, after this
expectation set was frozen in 14z-64, so the set had no entry for it and
run_suite.sh reported NO-EXPECTATION -> SUITE RED with 0 FAIL and 0 divergence.
A replay added after a freeze may invalidate that freeze; the truthful
classification here is "not applicable to this build", not a frozen checksum.
